      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……って何だろうこの資料。\r\n誰かの記録みたいだ。",
        "official_en": "I wonder what this document could be? It seems like a personal account.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
