      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42:FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_015:b7b806bb",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42",
        "key": "FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_015",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42:FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_015:b7b806bb",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42:FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_015:b7b806bb",
        "jp_sha256": "0b882a95be9266b7f0c85f105464941ab0d758be5bfb15968c63acbb0f1c5bc6",
        "official_en_sha256": "df99f374960cc6d11a0e0e641a878979125d06545c170b8019e99503f7a39802"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ええっと、植物図鑑は確か……。\r\nあの階段を上って、その昇降機を降りて\r\nこの道を進んで……、どの本棚を探すんだっけ？",
        "official_en": "So the botanical encyclopedia is...up those stairs, down that elevator, straight down the hall and... Rats, which shelf was it?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
          "label_jp": "魔法使いの少年",
          "label_status": "VERIFIED",
          "name_entry": "CharaName0227",
          "identity": null,
          "runtime_character_id": null,
          "evidence_refs": [
            "key-identities:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42/FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_015"
          ]
        },
        "addressee": null,
        "branch_ref": null,
        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42:FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_060:ae29b776",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42",
        "key": "FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_060",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42:FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_060:ae29b776",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42:FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_060:ae29b776",
        "jp_sha256": "33f77f0ac46f24bc708ebdcc471f0928992c47d0c4b9b7f9df1e8c88baeb093a",
        "official_en_sha256": "674c07dc19f4d158bab9d75988858c9ae76a5a3c19a229a07597607eddc28c21"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "お、お腹空いたなぁ……。\r\n本に夢中でご飯を食べるの忘れてたよ。",
        "official_en": "I’m absolutely famished... I’ve been so absorbed in this book that I’ve forgotten to eat.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42",
