    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42:FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_010:4c8a9d55",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42",
        "key": "FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_010",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42:FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_010:4c8a9d55",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42:FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_010:4c8a9d55",
        "jp_sha256": "a14e8ffbdf1c4e351fc1e033a534da96252a73677bf8e6fee309b35792c52a31",
        "official_en_sha256": "b67a7a7cd0db6b5cb956f8017c3008d3f16afc2341f7eeaef71e35e24bb14281"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここに収められている本にはね\r\n危険な魔道書なんかもあるんだ。\r\n持っているだけで命を吸い取るものとかね。",
        "official_en": "There are books of a dangerous nature stored here—grimoires, for instance, that are said to drain the life of their bearer.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
          "label_jp": "黒魔道士",
          "label_status": "VERIFIED",
          "name_entry": "CharaName0052",
          "identity": null,
          "runtime_character_id": null,
          "evidence_refs": [
            "key-identities:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42/FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_010"
          ]
        },
        "addressee": null,
        "branch_ref": null,
        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42:FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_002:40906230",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42",
        "key": "FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_002",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42:FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_002:40906230",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42:FEV_Dng_07Mys_42_002:40906230",
        "jp_sha256": "32435a9a44d9543fcd815883c41f5653f3a93eefeb3fbcf78dff44ef4792f66e",
        "official_en_sha256": "82a1084ab25143dd11754db4bd77b701aaa6f366782d9951102867d4ed2acee3"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここの書物を読むことで、先人たちの\r\n知恵を一気に得ることができるわ。",
        "official_en": "These books will grant you the boundless knowledge of our forebears.",
        "real_en": "By reading these books, you can learn the wisdom of those who came before us all at once."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_42",
