      "text": {
        "jp": "その顔は帰り方が分からなくなった顔ね。\r\nそこの“Ⅰ”の昇降機に乗って\r\n階段をひたすら下りれば帰れるわよ。",
        "official_en": "You look as though you can’t seem to find your way out. Simply hop on that “I” elevator and take the stairs down, and you’ll reach the lobby shortly.",
