      "text": {
        "jp": "だけど、重要なのは書を読み学び\r\nその後、実践することなのよ。\r\nまぁ、入り浸ってる人もいるけどね。",
        "official_en": "While some are content simply acquiring this knowledge, what truly matters is applying all that you learn.",
        "real_en": "But the important part is reading, learning, and then putting it into practice. Though some people practically live in here."
