      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "わたしよりもね、むずかしい本を読んでた……\r\nなんか負けた気分。",
        "official_en": "It was a book that even I can’t understand... This kitty can’t be smarter than me, can he?",
        "real_en": "It was reading a book even harder than the ones I read... I feel like I've lost somehow."
