      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "空の厄災とラピス王国について\r\n調べたかったんだが……\r\nいやはや、なんて広さだ……。",
        "official_en": "I’ve come to research the great calamity of the skies and the kingdom of Lapis, but...holy moly, the size of this place...",
